### def autoclose? -> bool

auto-close フラグを返します。

```ruby title="例"
IO.open(IO.sysopen("testfile")) do |io|
  io.autoclose?         # => true
  io.autoclose = false
  io.autoclose?         # => false
end
```

- **SEE** [m:IO#autoclose=]

